---
title: AI-assisted development workflow with human gates
---
flowchart LR
  spec[1 Write feature spec<br/>specs/features/*.md] --> ctx[2 Load repo context files<br/>ai-engineering/context]
  ctx --> gen[3 AI drafts code and tests<br/>implementation, testing agents]
  gen --> self[4 Developer reads every line<br/>compare with flawed-AI catalog]
  self --> chk[5 Automated gates<br/>unit tests, scanners, CI]
  chk --> rev[6 Human code review<br/>PR checklist, security agent notes]
  rev --> dod[7 Definition of done<br/>docs updated, evidence recorded]
  rev -->|findings| gen
  chk -->|failures| gen
  dod --> learn[8 Capture lesson:<br/>update context or flawed examples]
  learn -.-> ctx
